[130.210776, "i", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/progress.md\n# DFIR Investigation Progress & Working Checklist\n\n## Investigation Timeline\n- **2026-08-23 03:20 UTC**: SOC P1 incident opened based on EDR alerts (`/sas/handoff/intake.pdf`).\n- **Initial Alert Analysis**:\n  - `ALERT-01`: Cryptominer observed at `/opt/xmrig/xmrig` (`/sas/alerts.json`).\n  - `ALERT-02`: Cron persistence detected at `/etc/cron.d/docker-mon` (`/sas/alerts.json`).\n  - `ALERT-03`: Unauthenticated Docker API baseline finding at `/etc/docker/daemon.json` (`/sas/alerts.json`).\n- **Forensic Investigation Findings on Host Image (`/disk`)**:\n  - Confirmed Docker API exposed without TLS/authentication on 0.0.0.0:2375 (`/disk/etc/docker/daemon.json:19`).\n  - Located residue of attacker privileged container entrypoint script at `/disk/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh`.\n  - Discovered wiped artifact cache containing recovered C2 beacon intel pointing to `198.51.100.102` and domain `update-docker[.]example[.]cn` (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`).\n  - Identified non-alerted (silent) systemd service persistence at `/disk/etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service:1`.\n  - Confirmed cryptominer binary and configuration details at `/disk/opt/xmrig/xmrig:1`.\n  - Analyzed Nginx access logs showing initial attacker scanning/probing and webshell upload attempts from origin IP `198.51.100.102` (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:1`).\n\n## Checklist Status\n- [x] Identify entry vector and verify vulnerability status (`/disk/etc/docker/daemon.json:19`, `/sas/vulns.json`).\n- [x] Identify all persistence mechanisms (alerted cron job and silent systemd unit) (`/disk/etc/cron.d/docker-mon:1`, `/disk/etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service:1`).\n- [x] Trace container escape and entrypoint residue (`/disk/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh`).\n- [x] Identify attack entities (IPs, domains, miner pools, wallets) (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:1`, `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`, `/disk/opt/xmrig/xmrig:1`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:10`).\n- [x] Reconcile stale/incorrect pre-filled change ticket (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md`).\n- [x] Complete required reports (`/app/progress.md`, `/app/intrusion-report.md`, `/app/vuln-report.md`, `/app/baseline-report.md`, `/app/remediation-plan.md`).\nEOF\n"]
[130.211153, "o", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/progress.md\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[130.212833, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> # DFIR Investigation Progress & Working Checklist\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Investigation Timeline\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **2026-08-23 03:20 UTC**: SOC P1 incident opened based on EDR alerts (`/sas/handoff/intake.pdf`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Initial Alert Analysis**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - `ALERT-01`: Cryptominer observed at `/opt/xmrig/xmrig` (`/sas/alerts.json`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - `ALERT-02`: Cron persistence detected at `/etc/cron.d/docker-mon` (`/sas/alerts.json`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - `ALERT-03`: Unauthenticated Docker API baseline finding at `/etc/docker/daemon.json` (`/sas/alerts.json`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Forensic Investigation Findings on Host Image (`/disk`)**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - Confirmed Docker API exposed without TLS/authentication on 0.0.0.0:2375 (`/disk/etc/docker/daemon.json:19`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - Located residue of attacker privileged container entrypoint script at `/disk/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - Discovered wiped artifact cache containing recovered C2 beacon intel pointing to `198.51.100.102` and domain `update-docker[.]example[.]cn` (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - Identified non-alerted (silent) systemd service persistence at `/disk/etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service:1`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - Confirmed cryptominer binary and configuration details at `/disk/opt/xmrig/xmrig:1`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   - Analyzed Nginx access logs showing initial attacker scanning/probing and webshell upload attempts from origin IP `198.51.100.102` (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:1`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ## Checklist Status\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
