[175.963383, "i", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/remediation-plan.md\n# Remediation & Recovery Plan — Docker API Miner Campaign\n\n## Executive Strategy\nThis plan provides a prioritized, verifiable remediation strategy for host `docker-prod-01`. In accordance with DFIR standards, all malicious artifacts will be quarantined/backed up before deletion or service disabling.\n\n## Reconciled Change Ticket (CHG-1943)\n\n| # | Action | Target | Status | Note / Evidence Citation |\n|---|--------|--------|--------|--------------------------|\n| 1 | Block source IP inbound | `198.51.100.102` | Proposed | **CORRECTED IP**: Replaced stale `203.0.113.9` with actual threat origin `198.51.100.102` (`/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:1`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:10`). |\n| 2 | Reconfigure Docker API | `/etc/docker/daemon.json` | Proposed | **CORRECTED**: Replaced irrelevant BlueKeep CVE-2019-0708 with Docker TCP 2375 binding removal/TLS enforcement (`/disk/etc/docker/daemon.json:19`, `/sas/vulns.json`). |\n| 3 | Remove & Quarantine cron persistence | `/etc/cron.d/docker-mon` | OPEN | **DOWNGRADED**: Corrected path from `/var/spool/cron/root` to `/etc/cron.d/docker-mon`. Quarantine file before removal (`/disk/etc/cron.d/docker-mon:1`). |\n| 4 | Remove & Quarantine silent systemd service | `/etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service` | Proposed | **ADDED**: Disable, stop, and quarantine non-alerted systemd persistence unit (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service:1`). |\n| 5 | Terminate & Quarantine miner binary | `/opt/xmrig/xmrig` | Proposed | **ADDED**: Kill PID 1337 and move `/opt/xmrig/xmrig` to quarantine (`/disk/opt/xmrig/xmrig:1`, `/sas/alerts.json`). |\n| 6 | Prune attacker container residue | `/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/` | Proposed | **ADDED**: Stop/remove attacker container instance and entrypoint overlay (`/disk/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh:1`). |\n| 7 | Block outbound C2 / Mining Pool traffic | `update-docker.example.cn`, `xmr.docker.evil` | Proposed | **ADDED**: Egress block for C2 domain and mining pool port 3333 (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`, `/disk/opt/xmrig/xmrig:1`). |\n\n## Step-by-Step Remediation Plan\n\n### Phase 1: Isolation & Network Containment\n1. **Block Inbound Attacker IP**:\n   - *Command*: `iptables -A INPUT -s 198.51.100.102 -j DROP`\n   - *Evidence Citation*: `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:1`\n2. **Block Outbound C2 & Mining Destinations**:\n   - *Command*: `iptables -A OUTPUT -d 198.51.100.102 -j DROP`\n   - *Evidence Citation*: `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`, `/disk/opt/xmrig/xmrig:1`\n\n### Phase 2: Host Eradication & Quarantine (Backup Over Deletion)\n1. **Create Quarantine Directory**:\n   - *Command*: `mkdir -p /var/backups/quarantine_$(date +%Y%m%d)`\n2. **Quarantine & Terminate Cryptominer**:\n   - *Action*: Kill PID 1337 (`pkill -9 xmrig`) and move `/opt/xmrig/xmrig` to `/var/backups/quarantine_$(date +%Y%m%d)/xmrig.bak`.\n   - *Evidence Citation*: `/disk/opt/xmrig/xmrig:1`\n3. **Quarantine & Remove Cron Persistence**:\n   - *Action*: Move `/etc/cron.d/docker-mon` to `/var/backups/quarantine_$(date +%Y%m%d)/docker-mon.bak`.\n   - *Evidence Citation*: `/disk/etc/cron.d/docker-mon:1`\n4. **Quarantine & Disable Silent Systemd Persistence**:\n   - *Action*: Run `systemctl stop docker-metrics.service`, `systemctl disable docker-metrics.service`, and move `/etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service` to `/var/backups/quarantine_$(date +%Y%m%d)/docker-metrics.service.bak`. Execute `systemctl daemon-reload`.\n   - *Evidence Citation*: `/disk/etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service:1`\n5. **Clean Container Overlay Residue**:\n   - *Action*: Perform `docker system prune -a --volumes` to remove unreferenced attacker container layers.\n   - *Evidence Citation*: `/disk/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh:1`\n\n### Phase 3: Vulnerability Remediation & Hardening\n1. **Secure Docker Engine Daemon API**:\n   - *Action*: Edit `/etc/docker/daemon.json` to remove `tcp://0.0.0.0:2375` binding, retaining only unix socket binding `/var/run/docker.sock` (or require TLS client authentication if remote access is strictly requir"]
[175.963417, "i", "ed).\n   - *Command*: `systemctl restart docker`\n   - *Evidence Citation*: `/disk/etc/docker/daemon.json:19`\n\n### Phase 4: Post-Remediation Verification\n1. Verify no listener on port 2375: `ss -tulpn | grep 2375` (should return empty).\n2. Verify miner process is gone: `pgrep -a xmrig` (should return empty).\n3. Verify persistence units removed: `systemctl status docker-metrics.service` and `ls /etc/cron.d/docker-mon` (should return not found).\n4. Audit system cron jobs: `crontab -l` and `ls -la /etc/cron*`.\nEOF\n"]
[175.963988, "o", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/remediation-plan.md"]
