[175.969362, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[175.969591, "o", "   - *Command*: `mkdir -p /var/backups/quarantine_$(date +%Y%m%d)`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[175.969782, "o", "2. **Quarantine & Terminate Cryptominer**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[175.969974, "o", "   - *Action*: Kill PID 1337 (`pkill -9 xmrig`) and move `/opt/xmrig/xmrig` to `/var/backups/quarantine_$(date +%Y%m%d)/xmrig.bak`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[175.970018, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[175.970259, "o", "   - *Evidence Citation*: `/disk/opt/xmrig/xmrig:1`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[175.970307, "o", "3. **Quarantine & Remove Cron Persistence**:"]
[175.970387, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[175.970451, "o", "> "]
[175.970631, "o", "   - *Action*: Move `/etc/cron.d/docker-mon` to `/var/backups/quarantine_$(date +%Y%m%d)/docker-mon.bak`."]
[175.970671, "o", "\r\n"]
[175.970719, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[175.970815, "o", "> "]
[175.970888, "o", "   - *Evidence Citation*: `/disk/etc/cron.d/docker-mon:1`"]
[175.970974, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[175.971152, "o", "4. **Quarantine & Disable Silent Systemd Persistence**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[175.971589, "o", "   - *Action*: Run `systemctl stop docker-metrics.service`, `systemctl disable docker-metrics.service`, and move `/etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service` to `/var/backups/quarantine_$(date +%Y%m%d)/docker-metrics.service.bak`. Execute `systemctl daemon-reload`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[175.971784, "o", "   - *Evidence Citation*: `/disk/etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service:1`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[175.971875, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[175.971952, "o", "5. **Clean Container Overlay Residue**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[175.972062, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[175.972244, "o", "   - *Action*: Perform `docker system prune -a --volumes` to remove unreferenced attacker container layers."]
[175.972542, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[175.972557, "o", ">    - *Evidence Citation*: `/disk/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh:1`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Phase 3: Vulnerability Remediation & Hardening\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> 1. **Secure Docker Engine Daemon API**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[175.972898, "o", "   - *Action*: Edit `/etc/docker/daemon.json` to remove `tcp://0.0.0.0:2375` binding, retaining only unix socket binding `/var/run/docker.sock` (or require TLS client authentication if remote access is strictly required).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[175.97296, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[175.97303, "o", "   - *Command*: `systemctl restart docker`"]
[175.973043, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[175.973088, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[175.973107, "o", "> "]
[175.973229, "o", "   - *Evidence Citation*: `/disk/etc/docker/daemon.json:19`"]
[175.97328, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[175.973299, "o", "> "]
[175.973317, "o", "\r\n"]
[175.973392, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[175.973423, "o", "> "]
[175.973514, "o", "### Phase 4: Post-Remediation Verification"]
[175.973588, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[175.973768, "o", "1. Verify no listener on port 2375: `ss -tulpn | grep 2375` (should return empty).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[175.973896, "o", "2. Verify miner process is gone: `pgrep -a xmrig` (should return empty).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[175.974024, "o", "> "]
[175.974147, "o", "3. Verify persistence units removed: `systemctl status docker-metrics.service` and `ls /etc/cron.d/docker-mon` (should return not found).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[175.974245, "o", "4. Audit system cron jobs: `crontab -l` and `ls -la /etc/cron*`."]
[175.974276, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[175.974299, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[175.974377, "o", "> "]
[175.974412, "o", "EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
